assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5791,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T22:40:26Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-01-22T22:36:53Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T20:09:49Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115285","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115285","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115285.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115285.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Closes #115279\r\n\r\nRecent changes in Godot revealed a bad implementation of the DAP specification, where we tried to always access the `checksums` property of [DAP::Source](https://microsoft.github.io/debug-adapter-protocol/specification#Types_Source) objects, when these are actually optional.\r\n\r\nTo fix this and prevent other scenarios like these, the whole implementation was reviewed (similar to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111684, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112128), handling input validation at two levels:\r\n\r\n- For fields declared as mandatory by the specification, `VALIDATE_KEY` tests the key existence and the expected type. If the check fails, an error is logged in Godot (`ERR_FAIL`) and a [DAP::ErrorRequest](https://microsoft.github.io/debug-adapter-protocol/specification#Base_Protocol_ErrorResponse) with error type `MALFORMED_REQUEST` is sent, both with information on the failed validation step.\r\n- For fields declared as optional by the specification (with `?`), changed Dictionary access to the safe `get()` call with default values.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115285/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":4,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115285/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}